<string name="htu_getting_started_title">1. Getting Started</string>
    <string name="htu_getting_started_desc">Open the application, complete your initial setup, configure your user profile, and set basic preferences like your daily wage and working hours.</string>
    <string name="htu_attendance_title">2. Attendance</string>
    <string name="htu_attendance_desc">Mark your attendance daily as Present, Half Day, or Absent. You can view, edit, and keep track of your date-based attendance records easily.</string>
    <string name="htu_earnings_title">3. Earnings</string>
    <string name="htu_earnings_desc">Calculates your earnings based on your daily wage configuration, base salary, overtime hours, advances, and overall attendance.</string>
    <string name="htu_calendar_title">4. Calendar</string>
    <string name="htu_calendar_desc">Open the Calendar to select specific dates and view your attendance records with color-coded indicators.</string>
    <string name="htu_passbook_title">5. Passbook</string>
    <string name="htu_passbook_desc">Review your daily records including earnings, overtime, advance amounts, and personal notes. You can search, sort, and view your complete monthly summary.</string>
    <string name="htu_all_time_passbook_title">6. All Time Passbook</string>
    <string name="htu_all_time_passbook_desc">Your full historical records organized by year and month. Expand or collapse monthly blocks to view detailed attendance and financial summaries.</string>
    <string name="htu_statistics_title">7. Statistics</string>
    <string name="htu_statistics_desc">Visualize your overall earnings and attendance statistics. Dive deep into your financial summaries and drill-down into specific records.</string>
    <string name="htu_backup_restore_title">8. Backup &amp; Restore</string>
    <string name="htu_backup_restore_desc">Keep your data safe by creating backups. You can share or save these files, and restore them later to recover your records safely.</string>
    <string name="htu_pdf_export_title">9. PDF Export</string>
    <string name="htu_pdf_export_desc">Generate professional PDF reports for your Monthly Passbook or All Time Passbook and share them instantly via WhatsApp or other apps.</string>
    <string name="htu_language_title">10. Language</string>
    <string name="htu_language_desc">Switch between English and Hindi languages for a fully localized user interface.</string>
    <string name="htu_settings_title">11. Settings</string>
    <string name="htu_settings_desc">Manage your app preferences, contact the developer, read the Privacy Policy and Terms &amp; Conditions, and explore more help topics.</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro">WorkDaily is committed to protecting your privacy through an offline-first architecture. This Privacy Policy details how your local data, notifications, exported files, and preferences are handled.</string>
    <string name="privacy_local_data_title">1. Local Storage &amp; Data Handling</string>
    <string name="privacy_local_data_desc">All user-entered data—including profile information (name, avatar photo), daily wage configurations, attendance logs, overtime hours, advance payments, notes, and preferences—is stored exclusively on your device inside Room SQLite database, DataStore preferences, and app-private internal storage. WorkDaily operates without a backend cloud server, user account requirement, or external data transmission.</string>
    <string name="privacy_notifications_title">2. Local Notifications &amp; System Permissions</string>
    <string name="privacy_notifications_desc">WorkDaily uses system AlarmManager and WorkManager to deliver local attendance reminders and earnings summaries directly on your device. Notification content may dynamically include your configured wage rate or calculated work summaries. Notifications are generated 100% locally on device. You can grant or revoke notification permissions at any time in Android Settings, and lock screen visibility of notification content depends on your device notification privacy settings.</string>
    <string name="privacy_exports_title">3. PDF Exports &amp; Backup Files</string>
    <string name="privacy_exports_desc">PDF Passbook reports and ZIP backup packages are compiled locally on your device. When you choose to export or share a PDF report or backup ZIP file, you select the destination application or storage location via the Android system Sharesheet. WorkDaily does not automatically upload or transmit your backup files to external servers.</string>
    <string name="privacy_sharing_title">4. Third-Party Services &amp; External Links</string>
    <string name="privacy_sharing_desc">WorkDaily does not integrate third-party analytics, advertising SDKs, tracking frameworks, or cloud synchronization services. Optional external links (such as WhatsApp Channel, Telegram, Instagram, YouTube, or support email) launch external applications which are governed by their respective privacy policies.</string>
    <string name="privacy_deletion_title">5. Data Retention &amp; Deletion</string>
    <string name="privacy_deletion_desc">Your data remains on your device for as long as the application is installed or until you explicitly delete individual records, perform a reset, or clear application data. Uninstalling WorkDaily permanently removes all internal database records and local profile assets. User-created backup ZIP files saved outside application directories must be managed or deleted manually by the user.</string>
    <string name="privacy_contact_title">6. Support &amp; Contact Information</string>
    <string name="privacy_contact_desc">If you have any questions or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy or data handling in WorkDaily, please contact SynFusion at workdaily.synfusion@gmail.com.</string>

    <string name="terms_acceptance_title">1. Acceptance of Terms</string>
    <string name="terms_acceptance_desc">By installing, accessing, or using WorkDaily, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please refrain from using the application.</string>
    <string name="terms_use_title">2. Description &amp; Scope of Application</string>
    <string name="terms_use_desc">WorkDaily is a personal, offline-first productivity tool designed for logging daily attendance, calculating wage estimates, managing advances, and generating personal Passbook reports for individual record-keeping.</string>
    <string name="terms_responsibilities_title">3. User Responsibilities &amp; Record Accuracy</string>
    <string name="terms_responsibilities_desc">You are solely responsible for ensuring the accuracy of all entries made in WorkDaily, including wage rates, attendance statuses, overtime hours, and advance amounts. You are also responsible for maintaining the physical security of your device and any exported backup or PDF files.</string>
    <string name="terms_financial_title">4. Earnings &amp; Calculation Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="terms_financial_desc">Calculations in WorkDaily are provided strictly as convenience estimates based on user-entered values. WorkDaily is not a banking service, payment processor, tax advisor, or legal payroll system. You must independently verify all calculation totals before conducting financial settlements.</string>
    <string name="terms_notifications_title">5. Local Notification Service Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="terms_notifications_desc">WorkDaily schedules notifications locally on device for user convenience. Delivery times may be affected by OS battery optimization, background execution limits, or notification permissions, and notifications should not be treated as guaranteed legal or business alerts.</string>
    <string name="terms_backup_title">6. Backup &amp; Data Loss Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="terms_backup_desc">Because WorkDaily stores data offline without cloud synchronization, SynFusion cannot access, recover, or restore lost data resulting from device loss, damage, operating system updates, or application uninstallation. Users are solely responsible for creating and maintaining regular backup ZIP files.</string>
    <string name="terms_branding_title">7. Intellectual Property &amp; Branding</string>
    <string name="terms_branding_desc">All intellectual property rights in WorkDaily—including branding, source code, UI designs, graphics, and documentation—belong exclusively to SynFusion.</string>
    <string name="terms_contact_title">8. Contact &amp; Governing Law</string>
    <string name="terms_contact_desc">For legal inquiries or support regarding these Terms of Service, please contact SynFusion at workdaily.synfusion@gmail.com.</string>
